    "meta": {
      "id": "will-i-dream",
      "name": "Will I Dream",
      "description": "The universe begins on the downbeat: dark until play, then the big bang resolves into a straight flight through deep space, set to the track. Warp rides the hand toward the right and close to the sensors; every jump ends at a new arrival that grows in as the star trails slow. PAD 0 big bang, PAD 1 thrust surge, PAD 2 hyperspace jump, PAD 3 spawn an object, PAD 4 wormhole end, PAD 5 tunnel end, PAD 6 wormhole pt 1, PAD 7 black hole, PAD 8 and PAD 15 bank, PAD 9 wormhole transit, PAD 10 relativistic warp. The rack stays off.",
